// Sufficient proof-time congruence for the same raw composite in the two
// existing raw category facades. comp_fapp0 is not injective: compare every
// endpoint and both actual arrows as conditions, rather than inferring data
// from composite equality. No runtime identity/composition fold is added.
unif_rule
  @comp_fapp0 (Prof_cat $A $B) $P $Q $R $s $r
  ≡ @comp_fapp0 (Functor_cat $K Cat_cat) $P0 $Q0 $R0 $s0 $r0
  ↪ [ $K ≡ Product_cat (Op_cat $A) $B;
      $P ≡ $P0; $Q ≡ $Q0; $R ≡ $R0; $s ≡ $s0; $r ≡ $r0 ];
